        "node_id": "n_7_89421c",
        "thought_text": "The error in the current implementation is likely due to an incorrect base case initialization. The base case for sequences of length 1 should be set to 1 for all values of i, not just the first N values. This oversight causes the function to undercount the number of valid sequences.",
