        "node_id": "n_6_9656cd",
        "thought_text": "The current approach of using prime factors to optimize the search space is incorrect. The error in the output is due to an incorrect implementation of the dynamic programming solution. The DP table should be initialized with all 1s for the base case (K=1) and then filled based on the product of adjacent elements being at most N. The current implementation is not correctly handling the base case and the transition between states.",
